            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Cove 0.1.71</title></head><body><h1>Sign-in codes, one click away</h1><ul><li>When a verification or sign-in code arrives, Cove shows it in the menu bar for ten minutes. Click it to copy it.</li><li>A notification with Copy can show the code too (Settings → Menu bar → Sign-in codes).</li><li>New mail arrives sooner: between full syncs, Cove checks for new mail every 30 seconds (every minute on battery).</li><li>Only the code is taken from the email, and only from mail that arrived in the last ten minutes.</li><li>iPhone: a code gets its own notification with Copy, even when notifications are set to Important.</li></ul></body></html>
]]></description>
